@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
title State Machine Diagram - Booking Lifecycle v1.1

[*] --> MenungguKonfirmasi : owner submits request

MenungguKonfirmasi --> Terkonfirmasi : admin approves\n[slot revalidated and available]
MenungguKonfirmasi --> Ditolak : admin rejects\n[rejection reason recorded]
MenungguKonfirmasi --> Dibatalkan : cancellation allowed by policy

Terkonfirmasi --> DijadwalkanUlang : reschedule accepted
DijadwalkanUlang --> Terkonfirmasi : new slot confirmed
Terkonfirmasi --> Dibatalkan : cancellation allowed by policy
Terkonfirmasi --> TidakHadir : slot passed without check-in
Terkonfirmasi --> CheckIn : patient arrives

CheckIn --> MenungguAntrean : check-in data and queue number saved
MenungguAntrean --> SedangDilayani : called by staff
SedangDilayani --> SelesaiDilayani : service record completed

Ditolak --> [*]
Dibatalkan --> [*]
TidakHadir --> [*]
SelesaiDilayani --> [*]

note right of MenungguKonfirmasi
  Booking request is not confirmed
  until an authorized admin approves it.
  Slot capacity is revalidated at approval.
end note

note bottom of SelesaiDilayani
  Invoice/payment lifecycle is separate.
  Payment does not change Booking state.
end note
@enduml
